<title>UK: Euromarket turnover rose in week to Apr 24 - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover rose in week to Apr 24 - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and</p>
<p>related markets rose to $978.44 billion in the week to April 24</p>
<p>from $932.08 billion the previous week, International Securities</p>
<p>Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					  Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		     52.35		51.00</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues     27.81		25.48</p>
<p> Secondary market:		  926.08	     881.08</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    193.22	     203.37</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear	710.99	     688.70</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	    267.44	     243.38</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
